From: buttsc at uci.edu (Carter T. Butts)
Date: Tue Mar 27 00:29:10 2007
Subject: [statnet_help] two yes/no questions on ERGM in R (fwd)
In-Reply-To: <F16CD5EC-7F85-4572-893E-CEC9F305F5C5@indiana.edu>
References: <Pine.WNT.4.64.0703262002420.2192@orion>
