Hi Tore,

Thanks for the detailed description.

The starting decay parameter may be too low. You have started it at an
extreme (i.e., it is expecting a decay value).

Try:

model.02.1 <- ergm(g~edges + gwdegree(0.5))

If that does not work, email me offline...

Best,

Mark

